---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="MLIFT is a professional mini excavator manufacturer specialized in construction machinery.">
  
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> &raquo; About Us
      </div>
      <h1>About Us</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-section" style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
        <p>MLIFT is a professional manufacturer established in 2017, specialized in researching, developing and manufacturing construction machinery products. The products we manufacture include different models of small hydraulic excavators, excavator attachments and excavator trailers.</p>
        
        <p>Our company covers an area of about 150,000 square meters, and has approximately 300 employees in peak season, with annual sales reaching approximately USD20 million.</p>
        
        <p>Based on advanced equipment, excellent facilities, strict quality control and standardized management system, our products are sold to most countries and regions across Europe, America, Asia, Oceania and Africa. Most of our products have gained CE certification. We continue developing and improving our brand "MLIFT", and OEM is also welcome.</p>
        
        <p>We always follow ISO9001 international quality management system to control product quality, providing you with better products and service. Welcome to visit us for further discussion.</p>

        <h3 class="mt-20">Scientific Production Management</h3>
        <p>Our manufacturing facility is equipped with state-of-the-art production lines including laser cutting machines, robotic welding systems, CNC machining centers, and automated painting booths. Each excavator undergoes rigorous quality inspection before leaving our factory.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Hero image showcase -->
  <section class="py-40">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="/images/hero/hs-factory.jpg" alt="MLIFT Factory" style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/images/hero/hs-excavator-line.jpg" alt="MLIFT Excavator Production Line" style="width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
